Table 1: AudioMarathon results on Qwen2.5-Omni-3B:
WAR for ASR and Macro-F1 otherwise. Avg. is the unweighted mean
of each three-task category; Audio Authenticity contains only SD.
Single/double vertical rules separate category averages/categories. Bold / underlining mark the best/second-best pruning
scores per retention ratio; † marks scores above unpruned.
Prefill compute: mean TFLOPs to the first token over the same 80 80 randomly sampled duration-stratified clips.
ASR: automatic speech recognition; SCR: speech content reasoning;
SER: speech entity recognition; SED: sound event detection;
MC: music classification; ASC: audio scene classification;
ER: emotion recognition; SAR: speaker age recognition;
SGR: speaker gender recognition; SD: deepfake detection.

